                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks for accompanying documents (none, or give comments): Product passports are not issued on the manufacturer's letterhead (the logo, name, or address of the product manufacturer are missing - signs of falsification, Order No. 39/1065-P dated September 14, 2022, Appendix 1). In the passport for Enamel PF-115, the conditional viscosity according to the VZ-246 viscometer with a nozzle diameter of 4 b at (20+/-0.5) C is not within the normal range according to GOST 6465-76.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
